{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300","id":5905200127,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABX_oz_w","number":300,"title":"Raise the timber capacity (64) so a real room's framing fits; unify the five GEO-261 capacity constants","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-18T01:59:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T09:27:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**問題**:核心一個 World 最多 64 支角材(`WORLD_MAX_TIMBERS`)。下角材核心探針(#297)實跑時,F1 客廳要 108–116 支，第 65 支起全被拒(362 支);五房整套要 266–310 支。條文沒有規定這個數字(I33 只規定容量不足要回 CAPACITY),它是純實作常數，出處是 `決策佇列.md` B-15(暫定)。\n\n**調查**(全文:本機 `D:/geometry-axiom-work/core-probe-c2d218c2/capacity-analysis.md`):\n- main 只要改一行(`current_geometry.c` 的 `WORLD_MAX_TIMBERS`)。GEO-261 整合分支有五處各自寫死 64,而且互相沒有綁定:`WORLD_MAX_TIMBERS`、`WOOD_MEMBER_CAPACITY`、`WOOD_CONTACT_MEMBER_CAPACITY`、`WOOD_CUT_LIST_MEMBER_CAPACITY`、`WOOD_MEMBER_SPAN_MEMBER_CAPACITY`。只改其中一個會越界，而且照樣編得過。\n- 記憶體：每支角材槽 1888 bytes。放大到 512 時，每個 World 增加約 18–21%,約 70 份 World 合計多 56.5 MiB。\n- `print_cut_list` 有一個隨 N 平方成長的堆疊陣列，放大前要先修。\n- 其他上限：參考線 16(最差排法剛好用滿)、空間 4(五房就超過)。\n- **時間比記憶體更早碰壁**:依前綴重放擬合，五房整套一次載入約 22–27 秒，接近 bridge 30 秒逾時。這要另外處理(增量驗證或分批提交),不是靠加大常數。\n\n**決定(Claude 代決，可推翻)**:\n- 放大到 512。單房最大 116 支，有 4.4 倍餘裕;五房整套 310 支，有 1.65 倍。\n- **只在 GEO-261 合入後的 main 上做一次**,避免和檔案搬移衝突。\n- 把五個常數收斂成單一來源，以模板的 `WOOD_MEMBER_CAPACITY` 為準，並加上 `_Static_assert`。\n- 一併做：修 `print_cut_list` 的平方陣列;補「第 N 支接受、第 N+1 支拒絕」的邊界測試(附突變);重跑突變帳本;同步 `ARCHITECTURE.md` 等說明。\n- 放大後重跑 #297 探針，查那 362 支有沒有新的規則拒絕。\n- 參考線、空間上限與載入時間另開單。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}